<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002q e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002q-s " data-id="e0002q" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002q" id="walkability">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002r e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0002r-s " data-id="e0002r" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0002r">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002s e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002s-s " data-id="e0002s" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002s">
    			<img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-ykrhga-e0002t-s" data-interaction-id="e0002t" id="117" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-hutbook-alpine-traverse_walkers.jpg" width="1024" height="768" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-hutbook-alpine-traverse_walkers.jpg 1024w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-hutbook-alpine-traverse_walkers-300x225.jpg 300w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-hutbook-alpine-traverse_walkers-768x576.jpg 768w" alt="Walkers crossing a high alpine traverse in single file"/>		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002u e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002u-s " data-id="e0002u" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002u">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002v">Your pace, not an average one</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002w-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002w">We check each leg against your stated pace, the ascent, the technical grade and the daylight. <strong>If a leg is over nine hours for you we say so before you pay</strong>, not after.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002x e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002x-s " data-id="e0002x" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002x">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002y-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002y">The walkability check</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0002z" class="e-ykrhga-e0002z-s e-heading-base">A chain of beds is only a route if every night is a real day.</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00030-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00030">Four inputs, one verdict per leg. Change your pace and the whole chain re-checks itself in front of you — before a card is ever charged.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00031 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00031-s " data-id="e00031" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00031">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00032 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00032-s " data-id="e00032" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00032">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00033 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00033-s " data-id="e00033" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00033">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00034-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00034">5h 40</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00035 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00035-s " data-id="e00035" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00035">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00036-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00036">Day 4 · Cabane du Mont Fort to Louvie</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00037-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00037">Comfortable at your stated pace.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00038 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00038-s " data-id="e00038" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00038">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00039 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00039-s " data-id="e00039" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00039">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003a-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003a">9h 20</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003b e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003b-s " data-id="e0003b" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003b">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003c-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003c">Day 7 · Arolla to Cabane des Dix</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003d">Over nine hours. We flag it before you pay.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003e e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003e-s " data-id="e0003e" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003e">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003f e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003f-s " data-id="e0003f" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003f">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003g-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003g">4h 05</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003h e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003h-s " data-id="e0003h" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003h">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003i-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003i">Day 9 · Schönbiel to Zermatt</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003j-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003j">Short day. Room for the Matterhorn detour.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003k e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003k-s " data-id="e0003k" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003k" id="huts">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003l e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0003l-s " data-id="e0003l" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0003l">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003m e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003m-s " data-id="e0003m" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003m">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003n-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003n">What a night actually involves</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0003o" class="e-ykrhga-e0003o-s e-heading-base">A bunk, a shared bathroom, and dinner at six o'clock sharp.</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003p-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003p">A hut night is a bunk in a shared room, a shared bathroom, a hot meal at 6pm sharp, and lights out at 10. Bring a sleeping liner, earplugs and cash. That is the whole packing list debate.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003q e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003q-s " data-id="e0003q" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003q">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003r-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003r">Sleeping liner</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003s-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003s">Earplugs</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003t-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003t">Cash</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003u-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003u">Hut shoes provided</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003v e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003v-s " data-id="e0003v" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003v">
    			<img decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-ykrhga-e0003w-s" data-interaction-id="e0003w" id="115" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-hutbook-alpine-dorm.jpg" width="512" height="512" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-hutbook-alpine-dorm.jpg 512w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-hutbook-alpine-dorm-300x300.jpg 300w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-hutbook-alpine-dorm-150x150.jpg 150w" alt="Bunks made up in a shared alpine hut dormitory"/>		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003x e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003x-s " data-id="e0003x" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003x">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003y-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003y">22:00</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003z-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003z">Lights out, every hut, no exceptions. The 4am alpine starts are why.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00040 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00040-s " data-id="e00040" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00040" id="basket">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00041 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e00041-s " data-id="e00041" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00041">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00042 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00042-s " data-id="e00042" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00042">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00043-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00043">Booking a whole traverse</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e00044" class="e-ykrhga-e00044-s e-heading-base">Eleven wardens, eleven emails, eleven bank transfers. Or one basket.</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00045-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00045">Every hut on the chain is held together and confirmed together. If night seven cannot be filled, nothing is charged — you are never left holding six beds and a gap in the middle.</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00046-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00046"><strong>We charge 3 euro per booked night.</strong> The hut gets the rest, at the price they set, and we never mark up a bed.</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00047-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00047"><a href="#search" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		Search a traverse
	</a></p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00048 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00048-s " data-id="e00048" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00048">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00049 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00049-s " data-id="e00049" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00049">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004a-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004a">Basket · Haute Route, 4 to 15 September</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004b e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004b-s " data-id="e0004b" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004b">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004c e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004c-s " data-id="e0004c" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004c">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004d">Refuge du Trient</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004e-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004e">Night 3 · 2 beds</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004f-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004f">€68</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004g e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004g-s " data-id="e0004g" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004g">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004h e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004h-s " data-id="e0004h" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004h">
