    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004w-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004w">11 nights, 2 walkers, held together</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004x-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004x">€1,612</p>
		
</div>

