<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004y e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004y-s " data-id="e0004y" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004y">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004z-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004z">Our cut of that: €66. Three euro a night, and nothing else.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00050 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00050-s " data-id="e00050" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00050">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00051 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e00051-s " data-id="e00051" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00051">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00052 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00052-s " data-id="e00052" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00052">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00053-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00053">Weather windows</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e00054" class="e-ykrhga-e00054-s e-heading-base">Move the whole chain by three days, once, for free.</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00055-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00055">Book a chain, then move the whole thing by up to three days once for free if the forecast turns. That single feature is why most people use us instead of emailing eleven wardens.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00056 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00056-s " data-id="e00056" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00056">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00057 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00057-s " data-id="e00057" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00057">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00058 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00058-s " data-id="e00058" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00058">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e00059" class="e-ykrhga-e00059-s e-heading-base">Shift, do not cancel</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005a-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005a">One free shift of up to three days on the entire chain, re-checked for walkability at the new dates.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005b e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005b-s " data-id="e0005b" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005b">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005c e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005c-s " data-id="e0005c" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005c">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0005d" class="e-ykrhga-e0005d-s e-heading-base">Cancel free to 14 days</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005e-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005e">Full refund, our fee included, up to fourteen days before the first night.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005f e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005f-s " data-id="e0005f" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005f">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005g e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005g-s " data-id="e0005g" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005g">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0005h" class="e-ykrhga-e0005h-s e-heading-base">Storm clause</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005i-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005i">If a warden closes a hut for weather, that night is refunded whatever the notice.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005j e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005j-s " data-id="e0005j" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005j">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005k e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0005k-s " data-id="e0005k" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0005k">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005l e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005l-s " data-id="e0005l" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005l">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005m-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005m">An evening at 1,900 metres</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005n e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005n-s " data-id="e0005n" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005n">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005o e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005o-s " data-id="e0005o" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005o">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005p-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005p">17:00</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005q-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005q">Boots off at the door, soup on the table, the warden takes your name.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005r e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005r-s " data-id="e0005r" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005r">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005s e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005s-s " data-id="e0005s" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005s">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005t-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005t">18:00</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005u-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005u">Half board is served. One sitting, everybody at once, no late plates.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005v e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005v-s " data-id="e0005v" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005v">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005w e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005w-s " data-id="e0005w" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005w">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005x-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005x">22:00</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005y-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005y">Generator off, lights out. The 4am starters are already packed.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005z e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005z-s " data-id="e0005z" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005z">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00060-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00060">Half board and dietary needs</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e00061" class="e-ykrhga-e00061-s e-heading-base">The kitchen is told in its own language, weeks before you arrive.</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00062-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00062">Dietary requirements are passed to the warden in the local language when you book, not when you arrive hungry at 1,900 metres.</p>
					<img decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-ykrhga-e00063-s" data-interaction-id="e00063" id="116" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-hutbook-alpine-hut_dusk.jpg" width="1024" height="576" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-hutbook-alpine-hut_dusk.jpg 1024w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-hutbook-alpine-hut_dusk-300x169.jpg 300w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-hutbook-alpine-hut_dusk-768x432.jpg 768w" alt="A mountain hut lit from inside at dusk below the ridge"/>		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00064 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00064-s " data-id="e00064" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00064">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00065-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00065">Vegetarian, vegan, gluten free, nut allergy and halal are carried on the booking in German, French, Italian and Slovene. <em>The 6pm sitting waits for nobody, so tell us once and it travels with you.</em></p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00066 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00066-s " data-id="e00066" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00066">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00067 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e00067-s " data-id="e00067" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00067">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00068 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00068-s " data-id="e00068" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00068">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00069-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00069">Alpine club membership</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006a-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006a">€12–22</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006b">Alpine club members save between 12 and 22 euro a night. Enter your membership number once and it applies to every hut that honours it, automatically.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006c e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006c-s " data-id="e0006c" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006c">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006d">DAV · 4820 1179 6</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006e-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006e">Applied</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006f e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006f-s " data-id="e0006f" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006f">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006g e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006g-s " data-id="e0006g" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006g">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006h e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006h-s " data-id="e0006h" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006h">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006i-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006i">DAV · Germany</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006j-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006j">€12 to €18 a night</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006k-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006k">Honoured across Austria and South Tyrol too.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006l e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006l-s " data-id="e0006l" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006l">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006m e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006m-s " data-id="e0006m" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006m">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006n-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006n">ÖAV · Austria</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006o-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006o">€14 to €22 a night</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006p-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006p">Reciprocal rights on 1,100 of our huts.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006q e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006q-s " data-id="e0006q" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006q">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006r e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006r-s " data-id="e0006r" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006r">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006s-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006s">SAC · Switzerland</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006t-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006t">€12 to €20 a night</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006u-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006u">Applies automatically on the Haute Route chain.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006v">Reciprocal rights vary by hut. We only show the discount where the warden actually honours it, so the price you see is the price at the door.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006w e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006w-s " data-id="e0006w" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006w" id="search">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006x e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0006x-s " data-id="e0006x" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0006x">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006y e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006y-s " data-id="e0006y" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006y">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006z-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006z">Search a route</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e00070" class="e-ykrhga-e00070-s e-heading-base">Tell us the traverse and your pace. We will tell you which nights are real.</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00071-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00071">1,140 huts, six countries, one basket, three euro a night. Free to search, free to move once, and free to cancel up to fourteen days out.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00072 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00072-s " data-id="e00072" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00072">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00073 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00073-s " data-id="e00073" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00073">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00074 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00074-s " data-id="e00074" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00074">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00075-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00075">Traverse</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00076-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00076">Haute Route · Chamonix to Zermatt</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00077 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00077-s " data-id="e00077" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00077">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00078-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00078">Nights</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00079-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00079">4 to 15 September · 2 walkers</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007a e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0007a-s " data-id="e0007a" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007a">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007b">Pace</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007c-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007c">350 m ascent an hour, 7 hour days</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007d"><a href="#walkability" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		Check this chain
	</a></p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007e e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0007e-s " data-id="e0007e" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007e">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007f-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007f">Seven of eleven huts still have beds in that window. Availability moves daily.</p>
		
</div>

